{"title":"下载附件","icon":"","img":"","tags":"","hideInMenu":"false","text":"module","cls":"Wb.Module","properties":{"cid":"module","serverScript":"let full_name = Wb.get('full_name')\nlet sql = Wb.getRow({ sql: \"select count(0) as cnt from thjs.t_th_client_file_content where id = {?id?}\" })\nWb.info(sql)\nif (sql.cnt == 0) {\n  let file = Wb.getRow({ sql: \"select * from thjs.t_th_client_file where id = {?id?}\" });\n  let path = file.file_path;\n  let finalPath = path; // 默认使用原始路径（适配新系统 /data/thfxqfiles/...）\n\n  // 核心修改逻辑：判断是否为老数据（以 D:/thfxq/ 或 D:\\thfxq\\ 开头）\n  if (path && path.match(/^[Dd]:[\\/\\\\]thfxq[\\/\\\\]/i)) {\n    // 如果是老数据，直接将其替换为新系统的绝对路径前缀\n    // 将 D:/thfxq/xxx 替换为 /data/thfxqfiles/xxx\n    finalPath = path.replace(/^[Dd]:[\\/\\\\]thfxq[\\/\\\\]/i, '/data/thfxqfiles/');\n    // 统一将 Windows 的反斜杠替换为 Linux/Unix 的正斜杠，防止路径识别错误\n    finalPath = finalPath.replace(/\\\\/g, '/');\n    Wb.info(\"检测到老数据路径，已自动映射为新路径: \" + finalPath);\n  } else {\n    Wb.info(\"检测到新数据路径，直接使用: \" + finalPath);\n  }\n\n  // 直接使用处理后的绝对路径进行文件导出\n  Wb.exportData(new Wb.File(true, '../../../../../../../' + finalPath));\n} else {\n  let row = Wb.getRow({ sql: \"select content from thjs.t_th_client_file_content where id = {?id?}\", blob: true });\n  if (row && row.content) {\n    Wb.exportData(row.content, full_name, row.content.available());\n  }\n}\n\n\n"},"_icon":"module"}